   "subject": "Re: gheatmap: change width of cell border",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">There is no option in the gheatmap man page to change the cell border width (I am using v 1.8.2). If anyone else is having this problem, I did discover that setting color = NA removes the cell border. Having an option to specify the width might be a nice addition for the future. </div><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"></div>"
    ],
